{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36329","headline":"与桐庐郑明府 · 方干","name":"与桐庐郑明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"字人心苦达神明，何止重门夜不扃。\n莫道耕田全种秫，兼闻退食亦逢星。\n暎林顾兔停琴望，隔水寒猨驻笔听。\n却恐南山尽无石，南山有石合爲铭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}